But she only had the two boys for the first husband and I got them now.

439
00:23:46.220 --> 00:23:48.320
A twenty-five and a twenty-two.

440
00:23:48.320 --> 00:23:50.840
<v ARSENEAULT>So they’re getting a little older?

441
00:23:50.840 --> 00:23:55.880
<v ROBINSON>Well the twenty-five year old, he had accident and a head injury.

442
00:23:55.880 --> 00:24:01.760
He’s got a kind of a little disability and a kind of mental problem.

443
00:24:01.760 --> 00:24:05.960
But the other one, this his last year at LSU.

444
00:24:05.960 --> 00:24:09.320
Judy Gauthia-Montgomery and Elaine Robinson 4700.2615 T4569 23

445
00:24:09.320 --> 00:24:11.000
<v ARSENEAULT>Well that’s good.

446
00:24:11.000 --> 00:24:11.909
<v ROBINSON>Be graduating in May.

447
00:24:11.909 --> 00:24:13.273
<v ARSENEAULT>I’m sure you’re proud of him.

448
00:24:13.273 --> 00:24:13.727
<v ROBINSON>Oh, yeah.

449
00:24:13.727 --> 00:24:14.409
<v ARSENEAULT>You should be.

450
00:24:14.409 --> 00:24:16.000
<v GAUTHIA>I got a good basketball player.

451
00:24:16.000 --> 00:24:17.347
<v ROBINSON>I got two granddaughters there, too.

452
00:24:17.347 --> 00:24:17.571
<v ARSENEAULT>Wow.

453
00:24:17.571 --> 00:24:18.245
<v ROBINSON>And a niece.

454
