<v GAUTHIA>God bless you

635
00:33:10.793 --> 00:33:21.103
<v ROBINSON>The Valentine . . . I mean the P.E. teacher, I liked her more than the rest of Judy Gauthia-Montgomery and Elaine Robinson 4700.2615 T4569 32

