00:52:57.174 --> 00:53:00.149
And he’d always go and get people to vote.

1082
00:53:00.149 --> 00:53:01.471
Encourage them to vote.

1083
00:53:01.471 --> 00:53:05.438
Go to your house . . . Talk to you, that you need to vote.

1084
