1501
01:19:22.842 --> 01:19:24.105
I’ll do that.

1502
01:19:24.105 --> 01:19:24.947
I’ll give.”

1503
01:19:24.947 --> 01:19:28.316
Judy Gauthia-Montgomery and Elaine Robinson 4700.2615 T4569 71

1504
01:19:28.316 --> 01:19:38.000
<c.p>So I can remember them collecting money for different people that was sick, or somebody died . . . Didn’t have insurance or something like that.

1505
01:19:38.000 --> 01:19:41.368
